    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up with these crazy hives all over my arms and chest... i think it's just that seasonal allergy stuff hitting me hard lately. but my throat feels kinda tight too like its hard to swallow. should i just take like a double dose of my loratadine to knock it out or do i need to see someone?",
