      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. the tightness isn't like, painful or anything, it just feels a bit weird when i swallow. since i know for a fact i have hay fever right now, isn't it way more likely that this is just a bad allergy flare up? can i just take a couple extra of my allergy pills and see if it goes down in an hour?",
